WEBVTT

00:02:58.038 --> 00:03:01.204
what about the environment
helps us to learn,

00:03:01.246 --> 00:03:05.329
and all of those really contribute
to making robots a little bit smarter.

00:03:05.371 --> 00:03:08.496
Here are some of the things  I do -
just a little snapshot -

00:03:08.538 --> 00:03:10.163
one of the things is mirroring.

00:03:10.413 --> 00:03:14.079
So they say our ability
to look in a mirror and wave

00:03:14.121 --> 00:03:17.079
and actually recognize
that the person on the other side is us,

00:03:17.121 --> 00:03:19.496
that self-awareness,
is a sign of intelligence,

00:03:19.538 --> 00:03:22.371
and that allows us to then
look at someone pitch a ball

00:03:22.413 --> 00:03:25.829
and figure out,
"OK, I know how to pitch a ball,

00:03:25.871 --> 00:03:28.371
I'm going to mirror their improvement."

00:03:28.413 --> 00:03:29.871
And so I actually have a robot

00:03:29.913 --> 00:03:32.329
where we are trying to design
a robot health coach.